{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the first day at a new school, the transfer student greeted new classmates and took a seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Their desk mate, a girl named Freya, had an air of something special about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Busy with all the things that come with being new, the transfer student dozed off in the quiet classroom, only to wake up at sunset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By then, the school doors were locked. While wandering inside the school, the student encountered Freya again\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but something about her seemed a little strange...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[How to Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape from the locked school by solving puzzles while running away from Freya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b7 Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b7 Charming characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b7 Tense gameplay   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b7 Various skills and cutscenes unlocked as you play</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604030?t=1753758403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/151269490e0d408675b70daeec36ca08a09f2434/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753758403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/0906ebbef6dea0fdca618bc3bb03725ab33dec10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753758403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/0906ebbef6dea0fdca618bc3bb03725ab33dec10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753758403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Wolf Mate contains sexual content that:\r\n\r\n-There are sexy poses and